6c6c6fa6484a0073d92b9659370243497426","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/heavy-weapons.lua","source":"You replace your steamgun and attack with a lightning-charged staff to engage in close combat.\n\t\t\n\t\tDeals %d%% steamgun damage as lightning to enemies in a frontal arc, as well as reducing the damage they deal by %d%% for 3 turns. This counts as a melee attack but triggers ammunition on-hit effects. All shockstaff attacks will also make a shield slam for the same damage as lightning. \n\n\t\tYou can charge up to your steamgun's range to make shockstaff attacks.","source_tag":"tformat","target_preimage_sha256":"1180b5ccfee48e7659bb5fbf1633e2d828d46be10ca19f61e86ed3c6d0e91e83","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/heavy-weapons.lua","source":"You replace your steamgun and attack with a lightning-charged staff to engage in close combat.\n\t\t\n\t\tDeals %d%% steamgun damage as lightning to enemies in a frontal arc, as well as reducing the damage they deal by %d%% for 3 turns. This counts as a melee attack but triggers ammunition on-hit effects. All shockstaff attacks will also make a shield slam for the same damage as lightning. \n\n\t\tYou can charge up to your steamgun's range to make shockstaff attacks.","source_tag":"tformat","target_preimage":"你将你的蒸汽枪替换成一根通了强电的电棍，用于进行近战格斗。\n\n\t\t在前方造成 %d%% 闪电蒸汽枪伤害，并降低他们所造成的伤害 %d%%，持续 3 回合。这一效果视作近战攻击，但可以触发弹药的命中效果。所有电击棒伤害也会附加一次盾牌攻击，造成同样的闪电伤害。\n\n\t\t你可以冲刺进行电击棒攻击，冲刺范围等于蒸汽枪射程。","target_preimage_sha256":"1180b5ccfee48e7659bb5fbf1633e2d828d46be10ca19f61e86ed3c6d0e91e83","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-4d2f8031e94dec5144e8/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-4d2f8031e94dec5144e8","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-4d2f8031e94dec5144e8/manifest.json","observation_identity":"32f37174fc278188ae3b03893d4894817d52ec8dd6e23db1a89675794c7f4c2f","publication_commit":"664b6ff82ca064f47ccda1abe7c3ca2996fbfdc4","result_sha256":"cd7755e780e5bd9c5e9239fd8287179d37cc8b89dab271feff36bde8af0e5906","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-4d2f8031e94dec5144e8/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"d0e0e8759e78cc434cdbbad5e077bc975a2ee768de5e3b8e7fcdce8ad5a1d6fb","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"778c749fb25e861d5aa7b68cc96460170fe8ac456be3ace5b58ff6244def9e4c","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","logical_entry_identity":"8babf786fb04178c0e796a067e50375eb4c888bbb2f313d933e8bfdec49304fe","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"call_locator":"d0e0e8759e78cc434cdbbad5e077bc975a2ee768de5e3b8e7fcdce8ad5a1d6fb","component":"orcs","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","logical_entry_identity":"8babf786fb04178c0e796a067e50375eb4c888bbb2f313d933e8bfdec49304fe","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","parent_entry_revision_identity":"778c749fb25e861d5aa7b68cc96460170fe8ac456be3ace5b58ff6244def9e4c","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/lore/misc.lua","source":"The anti-scrying nexus you folk set up here is damn impressive, as is the time-release pseudo-rune powered by it - hard to find a spare spot on my skin for it, but I can feel it working for a few days after I'm back in Maj'Eyal.  Great for making sure we can get away from the West portal and disperse without the A.K. catching on or tracking us to a common point of convergence.\n\nGot a proposal, though.  With a few little tweaks, I could make one that doesn't require the bearer's consent to use.  You aren't the only ones buying slaves from me, and when I get a customer who wants them taken right back to the West, we have to do the anti-scrying enchantments ourselves.  I don't know if you've noticed, but proper mages still aren't easy to come by - I barely made a profit last time I did it.\n\nSay the word, and I'll send over the temporary rune design so you can set the nexus to recognize it.  No charge from me - if you accept it, it'll pay for itself.\n\n[i](You assume the elaborate, glowing shape below is an Ogric equivalent to a signature.)[/i] ","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage_sha256":"6a0ea47750bef590f4f4c8a4b017d03b77f6e51e424e317bde9a60807ff6b5e4","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/lore/misc.lua","source":"The anti-scrying nexus you folk set up here is damn impressive, as is the time-release pseudo-rune powered by it - hard to find a spare spot on my skin for it, but I can feel it working for a few days after I'm back in Maj'Eyal.  Great for making sure we can get away from the West portal and disperse without the A.K. catching on or tracking us to a common point of convergence.\n\nGot a proposal, though.  With a few little tweaks, I could make one that doesn't require the bearer's consent to use.  You aren't the only ones buying slaves from me, and when I get a customer who wants them taken right back to the West, we have to do the anti-scrying enchantments ourselves.  I don't know if you've noticed, but proper mages still aren't easy to come by - I barely made a profit last time I did it.\n\nSay the word, and I'll send over the temporary rune design so you can set the nexus to recognize it.  No charge from me - if you accept it, it'll pay for itself.\n\n[i](You assume the elaborate, glowing shape below is an Ogric equivalent to a signature.)[/i] ","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"老兄，你们设置的反侦测水晶真他妈够劲的，还有这个被它驱动的延时释放的伪符文——我的皮肤上没有什么空位了，但我能感受到，这玩意儿在我回马基埃亚尔之后几天都能用。这肯定能保证，我们可以安心从西部的传送门逃走，绝对不会被联合王国抓到，他们也肯定没法追踪我们的痕迹。\n\n现在，我现在有一个想法。只要稍微整一下，我就可以让这玩意儿不需要使用者的意愿就能工作。你不是唯一一个从我这里买奴隶的人，要是你想把他们带回西部去的话，我们可得好好做点反侦测的准备。我不知道你有没有注意到，但合格的法师如今还是很难请到——上次，我差点把老本都给赔光了。\n\n只要你一句话，我就把这个临时的符文设计发给你，你设置好水晶就能用了。我不收你的钱——只要你愿意用，这笔投入很快就能回本。\n\n[i]（你猜想，下面画着的这个精心设计的，闪闪发光的图案，在食人魔文化里有着和签名一样的用途。）[/i] ","target_preimage_sha256":"6a0ea47750bef590f4f4c8a4b017d03b77f6e51e424e317bde9a60807ff6b5e4","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-4d2f8031e94dec5144e8/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-4d2f8031e94dec5144e8","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-4d2f8031e94dec5144e8/manifest.json","observation_identity":"b870e75c62f82c26984f3d2ab57999e696a5e1c8f00f11b1dbea6d3831c253d3","publication_commit":"664b6ff82ca064f47ccda1abe7c3ca2996fbfdc4","result_sha256":"5068c8053047a5b61f4d0a2c258269761bd22965af2d7a75e0c3713de7dfb5ae","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-4d2f8031e94dec5144e8/results.jsonl"}}],"items_sha256":"9f7e5418980657734356faac6ae1817c076181335d2a05c37b47f4067a7cb5ff","kind":"production_review_v2_lite_repair_workset_v1","policy_sha256":"99dd4164ae278c74dd670ae726f8fea2f9c8e6ae7e44a9b9d9dd2f0753272b0a","recorded_at":"2026-09-27T03:55:43Z","recorded_by":"WP2L-5 EXECUTOR","schema_version":1}